{"title":"Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"172\"\u003eShoes Collection\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\"\u003eStep into sophistication with our Shoes Collection — a curated line of handcrafted designs that blend timeless elegance with modern edge. Made from premium leathers and exotic textures, each pair is a testament to exceptional craftsmanship and refined detail. From statement silhouettes to subtle luxury finishes, these shoes are designed for those who walk with confidence, style, and intention. Elevated, exclusive, and effortlessly bold.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"black-pony-lock-shoes","title":"Black Pony Lock Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"185\"\u003eBlack Pony Lock Shoes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRO: Rafinați și îndrăzneți fără efort, pantofii Black Pony Lock sunt confecționați din piele luxoasă de ponei, oferind o textură catifelată și un luciu natural elegant. Silueta lor sculpturală se inspiră din stilul clasic vestic, reinterpretat cu o notă modernă și rafinată. Destinați celor care apreciază eleganța atemporală cu un twist contemporan, acest model exclusiv reprezintă esența luxului discret.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"185\"\u003eBlack Pony Lock Shoes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"188\"\u003eEN: Elevated and effortlessly bold, the Black Pony Lock Shoes are crafted from luxurious pony hair leather, offering a sleek, velvety texture with a rich, natural sheen. Their sculptural silhouette draws inspiration from classic Western styles, reimagined with a refined edge. Designed for those who value timeless elegance with a modern twist, this exclusive pair is the epitome of understated luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52181992309072,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52181992341840,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52181992374608,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52181992407376,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52181992440144,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52181992472912,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52215035986256,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/WhatsAppImage2025-10-12at21.45.35_1.jpg?v=1760296291"},{"product_id":"ash-python-boots","title":"Ash Python Lock Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"608\"\u003eAsh Python Shoes \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRO:Îndrăzneți și sofisticați, ciocatele Ash Python sunt realizați manual din piele veritabilă de piton, într-o nuanță subtilă de gri-cenușiu care evidențiază modelul natural al pielii exotice. Cu linii precise și o formă puternică, acești bocanci îmbină măiestria artizanală cu un aer contemporan. Un design exclusiv, creat pentru cei care caută luxul cu atitudine.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"608\"\u003eAsh Python Shoes \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEN:Striking and sophisticated, the Ash Python Shoes are handcrafted from genuine python leather in a soft, ash-toned palette that highlights the natural pattern of the exotic skin. With sharp lines and a bold shape, these boots merge artisanal craftsmanship with contemporary flair. An exclusive design made for those who seek luxury with attitude.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52181995159888,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52181995192656,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52181995225424,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52181995258192,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52181995290960,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52181995323728,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52215072784720,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/WhatsAppImage2025-10-12at21.45.36_2.jpg?v=1760296604"},{"product_id":"black-leather-crico-print-short-shoes","title":"Black leather croco print short Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003eRO:\u003cspan\u003eRealizate din piele naturală cu textură croco, ciocatele D’Ortenzi îmbină spiritul liber al stilului western cu precizia și rafinamentul designului italian. Silueta lor structurată, tocul robust și finisajul premium le transformă într-o piesă statement – perfectă pentru femeia care îndrăznește să combine tradiția cu modernul.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFie că le porți într-o ținută urban-chic sau ca accent luxury într-un look minimalist, aceste ciocate emană atitudine, calitate și încredere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEN: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted from genuine black croco-textured leather, the D’Ortenzi ankle boots merge the bold energy of western style with the precision of Italian craftsmanship. Their structured silhouette, stable heel, and premium finish make them a powerful statement of elegance and individuality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect for women who embrace both tradition and modern edge, these boots elevate any outfit with confidence and sophistication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52205438239056,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52205438206288,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52205438173520,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52205438140752,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52205438107984,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52205438075216,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52215076913488,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/883E820B-75B4-4DBE-9051-2254ED489D10.jpg?v=1760639148"},{"product_id":"black-leather-croco-print-long-shoes","title":"Black leather croco print long Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003eRO:\u003cspan\u003eCu un design inspirat din spiritul western și rafinate prin meșteșug italian, ciocatele înalte D’Ortenzi din piele naturală croco neagră sunt expresia perfectă a luxului atemporal. Textura exotică, linia alungită și tocul elegant definesc o piesă statement pentru femeia care apreciază calitatea, independența și stilul sofisticat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSunt mai mult decât o pereche de încălțăminte – sunt o declarație de încredere și forță feminină.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEN: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandcrafted in Italy from genuine black croco-textured leather, the D’Ortenzi high ankle boots reinterpret the western heritage through the lens of modern luxury. The elongated silhouette, subtle heel, and refined craftsmanship embody effortless sophistication and bold femininity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for women who lead with confidence and style, these boots are a statement of strength and timeless elegance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52205451772240,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52205451739472,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52205451706704,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52205451673936,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52205451641168,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52205451608400,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52215073145168,"sku":null,"price":790.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/91DB6663-75A1-49BD-988B-9F3B0C4B283C.jpg?v=1760639546"},{"product_id":"suede-leather-casual-shoes","title":"Suede Cappuccino leather casual Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003eRO:\u003cspan\u003eRealizați din piele întoarsă premium, adidașii D’Ortenzi definesc o nouă perspectivă asupra eleganței casual. Silueta curată, platforma modernă și textura fină creează un echilibru perfect între rafinament și funcționalitate.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAcești adidași nu sunt doar o alegere stilistică, ci o declarație a bunului gust – dedicați celor care apreciază calitatea italiană și estetica discretă, dar puternică.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEN: Crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003efrom premium Italian suede, the D’Ortenzi sneakers redefine understated elegance. With a sleek silhouette, elevated sole, and refined texture, they offer a perfect fusion of modern design and luxurious comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore than footwear, they’re a statement of taste – designed for those who value quality, simplicity, and the sophistication of effortless style\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52205455901008,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52205455868240,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52205455835472,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52205455802704,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52205455769936,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52205455737168,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52214048948560,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/94C34665-09C0-4455-B29F-946C1F98C8E6.jpg?v=1760639781"},{"product_id":"shoe","title":"Suede Espresso Leather casual Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003eRO:\u003cspan\u003eRealizați din piele întoarsă premium, adidașii D’Ortenzi definesc o nouă perspectivă asupra eleganței casual. Silueta curată, platforma modernă și textura fină creează un echilibru perfect între rafinament și funcționalitate.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAcești adidași nu sunt doar o alegere stilistică, ci o declarație a bunului gust – dedicați celor care apreciază calitatea italiană și estetica discretă, dar puternică.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEN: Crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003efrom premium Italian suede, the D’Ortenzi sneakers redefine understated elegance. With a sleek silhouette, elevated sole, and refined texture, they offer a perfect fusion of modern design and luxurious comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore than footwear, they’re a statement of taste – designed for those who value quality, simplicity, and the sophistication of effortless style\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52215067738448,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52215067705680,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52215067672912,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52215067640144,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52215067607376,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52215067574608,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52215067541840,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/files\/2B9B2603-4765-49A9-82DC-BF0D9F33A58B.jpg?v=1760798053"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0912\/4865\/6720\/collections\/16A880DF-AA96-42C8-9964-49AD39FA8FE1.jpg?v=1760817720","url":"https:\/\/www.dortenzi.com\/collections\/shoes.oembed","provider":"D’Ortenzi","version":"1.0","type":"link"}